    {
      "post_id": 60,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "yo so real talk\u2014the AI writing suggestions feature on @NovaMind used to actually save me hours on essays \ud83d\udcdd but lately it feels like it's just... regurgitating generic stuff? like it used to get my voice, now it's all corporate fluff \ud83d\ude05\n\nhas anyone else noticed the quality dropping? or is it just me? used to justify the subscription cost but now i'm lowkey wondering if i should just go back to free tools \ud83d\udc80\n\n#NovaMind #AITools #StudentLife #TechFail"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 61,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "honestly been trying NovaMind Assistant for my photography workflow and it's been pretty solid for organizing my shots and editing notes \ud83c\udfa5 BUT the usage caps are killing me rn... like i hit my limit halfway through a project last week and just had to wait it out \ud83d\ude05 \n\nthe tool itself works great when i'm not throttled, but for someone doing this as a serious hobby the restrictions feel kinda tight. was hoping for more breathing room before needing to upgrade? might need to shop around unless they flex these limits a bit \ud83e\udd14\n\n#PhotographyTools #SaaS #NovaMind"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 62,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "\u2b50\u2b50\u2b50 \u2014 so here's the tea \u2615 novanmind assistant *could* be clutch for lesson planning on a budget, but the community side feels kinda... sparse? \ud83d\ude05 like i was hoping to swap ideas with other educators doing the side hustle thing, but it's giving ghost town vibes. the tool itself does what it says, no complaints there, but i'm not getting that energy of being part of something bigger, ya know? would def stick around if there were more teacher collabs happening \ud83e\udd1d #edtech #sidehustle #novanmind"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 63,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "finally found an AI that doesn't gatekeep my creativity \ud83c\udfa8 used to hit paywalls mid-brainstorm with other tools and it killed the whole vibe... novamind actually lets me *finish* a thought before the limits kick in \ud83d\ude2d the limits are still there but at least i know where they are now!! huge difference when you're trying to actually *make* something \ud83d\udcaa #creativetools #novaai"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 64,
      "day": 35,
      "content": "Day 3 of waiting on NovaMind support and still crickets \ud83e\udd97 \n\nTool itself does solid work for the price tbh\u2014saves me hours editing scripts\u2014but when you actually need help? Ghost town. Tried hitting them up about my account issue and genuinely nothing. \n\nLove the value when things work smooth, but this silence is wild \ud83d\udc80 hoping they get back to me before I have to pivot to something else \n\n#ContentCreator #SaaS #NovaMind"
    }
  ],
  "row_count": 5
}

