    "content": "Filed a P1 bug in NovaMind Assistant three weeks ago that completely breaks our context window handling at scale. Radio silence since ticket submission. No status updates, no acknowledgment, nothing. For a platform positioning itself as enterprise-ready, this is a significant gap. Support triage needs serious work."
