      "content": "been using NovaMind for like 2 weeks and honestly? the tool itself is solid \ud83e\udd14 but the support is literally ghosting me. submitted a ticket on monday, it's now friday and... nothing. not even an automated response lmao\n\nlike i get it, small team probably, but when you're charging monthly subscription fees you gotta have your support game together \ud83d\ude05 i can't run my client work on \"maybe someone will reply eventually\"\n\nmight have to jump ship tbh. can't afford to wait around for help when deadlines are tight \ud83d\udcc9 shame because the features are actually useful but reliability > features every time imo\n\n#SaaS #freelancelife #supportmatters"
